1
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:52,240
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:55,920
(This story is entirely fictional.
All settings are imaginary.)

3
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:58,360
=Episode 2=

4
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:08,040
Boss!

5
00:01:08,040 --> 00:01:08,719
Look over there!

6
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:16,959
That psycho's got a death wish.

7
00:01:16,959 --> 00:01:17,959
He jumped from that high?

8
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,200
And he's already hurt.

9
00:01:20,519 --> 00:01:21,359
Go! After him!

10
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:32,120
Yan, wake up.

11
00:01:33,599 --> 00:01:34,159
Wake up.

12
00:01:42,359 --> 00:01:43,040
Yan...

13
00:01:56,799 --> 00:01:57,439
Sihan...

14
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:00,640
(Lin Sihan, Zhou Yan's Girlfriend)

15
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:11,199
Sihan...

16
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:19,919
(Breaking news,)

17
00:02:19,919 --> 00:02:20,840
(a woman was found dead)

18
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:23,960
(in her rented apartment
early this morning.)

19
00:02:24,479 --> 00:02:26,160
(She has crossed the border)

20
00:02:26,160 --> 00:02:27,639
- You're awake.
- (and worked as a paid hostess)

21
00:02:27,639 --> 00:02:28,680
- You've been asleep for two days.
- (at Grand Royal)

22
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:30,199
(Entertainment Casino.)

23
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:34,319
Wait.

24
00:02:36,439 --> 00:02:37,360
What did she just say?

25
00:02:38,039 --> 00:02:38,919
What happened to that woman?

26
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:40,639
You know her?

27
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:42,560
She's my fiancée's best friend.

28
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:46,639
They came to Langia together
a while ago.

29
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:48,120
She said

30
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:49,599
that after the woman

31
00:02:50,439 --> 00:02:51,639
entered Langia from Huaguo,

32
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:54,080
she'd been working as a paid hostess
at Grand Royal Entertainment Casino.

33
00:02:56,280 --> 00:02:56,840
A paid hostess?

34
00:02:57,879 --> 00:02:58,400
Yeah.

35
00:03:01,479 --> 00:03:02,879
Sihan must have fallen for
the same scam I did.

36
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:04,840
Hey!

37
00:03:05,159 --> 00:03:05,840
Where are you going?

38
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:07,400
Suowen put a bounty on you.

39
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,319
Everyone's looking for you.

40
00:03:08,599 --> 00:03:09,800
You go out there,
you're as good as dead.

41
00:03:11,599 --> 00:03:13,479
I promised Sihan I'd always protect her.

42
00:03:14,199 --> 00:03:15,280
Even if it's a death trap,

43
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:17,080
I'm going in and bringing her back.

44
00:03:18,479 --> 00:03:20,080
Grand Royal is the fanciest club,

45
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:21,199
you can't go in like that.

46
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:27,039
Fine.

47
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,520
Might as well help you all the way.

48
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:29,400
Follow me.

49
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:31,199
I'll get you some decent clothes.

50
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:32,639
Thanks.

51
00:03:33,919 --> 00:03:35,199
I... I still don't know your name.

52
00:03:36,479 --> 00:03:36,960
Mona.

53
00:03:37,479 --> 00:03:38,479
Thanks. Thank you.

54
00:03:38,759 --> 00:03:39,280
Miss Mona.

55
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:45,640
(Grand Royal Ballroom)

56
00:03:53,640 --> 00:03:55,160
(Daya, Grand Royal Hostess)

57
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:13,199
Sir, Grand Royal is members only.

58
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:14,120
Members only?

59
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:15,000
Yes.

60
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:19,800
Hey, handsome!

61
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:20,879
Where are you going?

62
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:23,279
You said you'd top up tonight.

63
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:24,439
I'm with someone.

64
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:25,759
Hey, handsome!

65
00:04:25,759 --> 00:04:26,240
Maybe later.

66
00:04:26,639 --> 00:04:27,560
Go after him! Go!

67
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:29,920
So when are you going to top up?

68
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:30,560
Later.

69
00:04:31,399 --> 00:04:32,839
Hey, loser. What's your problem?

70
00:04:32,839 --> 00:04:34,000
I'll top up through you. Get me in.

71
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:34,240
Come on.

72
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:37,959
He's not a member. He can't go in.

73
00:04:38,399 --> 00:04:40,000
Seriously? Can't you see?

74
00:04:40,199 --> 00:04:41,920
He's my VIP.

75
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:43,240
- You can handle a VIP like him?
- He's with you?

76
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:44,279
Go on in.

77
00:04:51,759 --> 00:04:53,160
No membership, no entry.

78
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,639
Oh, it's Tujiu.

79
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:57,360
This place belongs to the Grand Royal.

80
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,519
No causing trouble here.

81
00:04:58,519 --> 00:05:00,920
Mr. Natuo personally gave the order.

82
00:05:01,199 --> 00:05:01,800
Please stay out.

83
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:03,600
So what if it's Natuo?

84
00:05:03,959 --> 00:05:05,279
Please cooperate.

85
00:05:05,279 --> 00:05:06,319
Tujiu.

86
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:07,439
Tujiu.

87
00:05:07,439 --> 00:05:09,279
Even our boss is wary of Natuo.

88
00:05:09,759 --> 00:05:10,519
We can't mess with him.

89
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,439
You think I don't know?

90
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:14,360
Do I need you to tell me?

91
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:16,920
Boss gave us strict orders.

92
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:17,920
We'll wait right here.

93
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:19,920
He'll have to come out sooner or later.

94
00:05:44,199 --> 00:05:45,120
Come on, dance!

95
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:46,000
Hey, handsome.

96
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,160
Seriously,

97
00:06:09,319 --> 00:06:10,519
what's with you?

98
00:06:11,879 --> 00:06:13,319
You came to Grand Royal

99
00:06:13,639 --> 00:06:15,319
to have a good time.

100
00:06:15,959 --> 00:06:17,720
So why do you have this on you?

101
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:20,040
I don't even know how it got there.

102
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,639
I borrowed these clothes from a friend.

103
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:25,240
Whatever.

104
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:26,839
You're cute,

105
00:06:26,879 --> 00:06:28,199
so I'll let it slide.

106
00:06:29,759 --> 00:06:31,000
Remember, you said you'd top up

107
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,920
a membership card through me today.

108
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,560
I just got you out of a jam.

109
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,399
What's my reward for this?

110
00:06:43,079 --> 00:06:45,319
I need your help finding someone.

111
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,639
Who is she to you?

112
00:06:56,839 --> 00:06:57,720
My girlfriend.

113
00:06:58,519 --> 00:06:59,199
Oh.

114
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,360
I think

115
00:07:01,639 --> 00:07:03,439
you should just go home.

116
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:05,800
What do you mean?

117
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:13,480
This...

118
00:07:14,399 --> 00:07:15,560
This is all the cash I've got on me.

119
00:07:15,959 --> 00:07:17,079
It's all I brought today.

120
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:22,959
Come with me.

121
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:30,600
Her Huaguo name is Lin Sihan.

122
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:32,199
Her English name is Rika.

123
00:07:32,959 --> 00:07:33,360
Yeah.

124
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:34,319
Lin Sihan.

125
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:35,160
She's my girlfriend.

126
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:36,240
Where is she?

127
00:07:37,399 --> 00:07:39,240
Ever heard of Songcai?

128
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:40,160
No.

129
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:42,079
His son, Natuo,

130
00:07:42,079 --> 00:07:44,800
is a big-shot rich heir in Langia.

131
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:48,920
Your girlfriend is Natuo's favorite now.

132
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:52,040
Look at you.

133
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:54,800
Even if you find her, what can you do?

134
00:07:55,439 --> 00:07:55,839
No way.

135
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,279
Sihan isn't like that.

136
00:07:57,519 --> 00:07:58,199
Tell me where she is.

137
00:07:58,199 --> 00:07:59,040
I'll find her myself.

138
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:00,160
I won't get you involved.

139
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:01,759
Let go. Let go!

140
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:04,399
It's not that easy to find her.

141
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:09,720
But

142
00:08:10,439 --> 00:08:11,439
in a couple of days,

143
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:14,720
Langia is holding
a jade appraisal event.

144
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:17,279
Natuo will definitely be there.

145
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:18,519
Rika

146
00:08:18,839 --> 00:08:20,319
will be there too.

147
00:08:21,839 --> 00:08:22,560
A jade appraisal event?

148
00:08:23,399 --> 00:08:24,079
Yeah.

149
00:08:24,279 --> 00:08:27,079
But you need an invitation to get in.

150
00:08:27,319 --> 00:08:28,839
For someone like you,

151
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:30,600
getting in won't be easy.

152
00:08:33,879 --> 00:08:35,159
Want an invitation?

153
00:08:36,039 --> 00:08:36,799
I can get you one.

154
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:39,879
Ten million.

155
00:08:40,559 --> 00:08:41,360
Ten million?

156
00:08:41,639 --> 00:08:44,039
I mean Langia dollars.

157
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:48,039
That's only about 300,000
in Huaguo currency.

158
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:50,120
300,000.

159
00:08:55,799 --> 00:08:56,519
How much for a ride?

160
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:57,600
Thirty.

161
00:08:57,799 --> 00:08:58,480
Too much.

162
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,200
Come down a little.

163
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:01,759
Thirty's fair. You won't get ripped off.

164
00:09:01,759 --> 00:09:02,960
I'll take you wherever you want.

165
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:03,879
Come down a little.

166
00:09:03,879 --> 00:09:04,840
Buddy, thirty...

167
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:05,919
Twenty. Let's go.

168
00:09:05,919 --> 00:09:06,600
Fine, fine.

169
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:08,200
He's trying to scam you.

170
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:10,639
Can't even afford thirty?

171
00:09:10,639 --> 00:09:12,120
You'll never afford a Bentley.

172
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:14,759
Hey!

173
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:16,000
Buddy!

174
00:09:16,639 --> 00:09:17,519
You're still alive?

175
00:09:17,559 --> 00:09:18,600
How'd you get out of there?

176
00:09:20,759 --> 00:09:21,559
Where are you going?

177
00:09:21,679 --> 00:09:22,519
I'll take you.

178
00:09:22,679 --> 00:09:24,200
Fifty. Cheap.

179
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:26,039
It's you!

180
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,639
You saw me get in with those scammers.

181
00:09:28,639 --> 00:09:29,679
Why didn't you warn me?

182
00:09:30,279 --> 00:09:31,679
I warned you.

183
00:09:31,679 --> 00:09:32,960
You didn't believe me.

184
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:34,519
Then why didn't you say it clearly?

185
00:09:34,799 --> 00:09:36,480
How was I supposed to spell that out?

186
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,759
If I said it outright,
they'd beat me up.

187
00:09:38,759 --> 00:09:39,840
Those guys work for Dashan.

188
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:40,639
They're gangsters.

189
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:41,399
Tujiu!

190
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:42,440
He's coming out!

191
00:09:42,759 --> 00:09:43,519
I'm not blind.

192
00:09:43,919 --> 00:09:44,600
Stop right there!

193
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:46,720
Go!

194
00:09:47,639 --> 00:09:48,000
Five hundred.

195
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:49,120
You just said thirty!

196
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:49,879
Five hundred.

197
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:51,120
Fine!

198
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:51,440
Go!

199
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:52,480
Go!

200
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:54,200
Go!

201
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:56,000
Go!

202
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:00,720
Hurry!

203
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:05,000
Stop!

204
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:10,240
Get off.

205
00:10:10,519 --> 00:10:10,960
Get lost!

206
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:42,440
Whoa!

207
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:46,679
Go!

208
00:10:50,279 --> 00:10:50,720
Remember this.

209
00:10:51,159 --> 00:10:52,080
The guy who saved you today is Ma Ding.

210
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:53,679
Have a seat.

211
00:11:01,399 --> 00:11:02,480
This your place?

212
00:11:03,519 --> 00:11:04,840
For now.

213
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:05,480
I was a street kid.

214
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:08,200
Folks around here raised me.

215
00:11:15,799 --> 00:11:17,559
Who's that in the photo on your altar?

216
00:11:18,279 --> 00:11:19,360
You don't know him?

217
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:20,639
Mian.

218
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,159
The King of Langia.

219
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:23,279
My idol.

220
00:11:24,279 --> 00:11:25,080
The King of Langia?

221
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:28,120
All the big bosses in Langia

222
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:29,879
used to be Mian's men.

223
00:11:30,279 --> 00:11:30,799
But

224
00:11:31,080 --> 00:11:32,320
no one's ever seen what he looks like.

225
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:33,799
All anyone knows

226
00:11:33,799 --> 00:11:35,279
is he has a dahlia on his chest.

227
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:37,480
Too bad.

228
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:39,080
He vanished three years ago.

229
00:11:42,919 --> 00:11:44,120
Got anything to eat,

230
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:44,960
Ma Ding?

231
00:11:45,399 --> 00:11:46,120
I'm a little hungry.

232
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:46,960
Yeah.

233
00:11:47,279 --> 00:11:47,559
Sit.

234
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:48,679
I'll get you something.

235
00:11:50,759 --> 00:11:51,879
I made it this morning.

236
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:53,320
I haven't even eaten yet.

237
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:55,679
You eat this with your hands?

238
00:11:56,600 --> 00:11:57,120
Yeah.

239
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:01,320
Everyone here eats like this?

240
00:12:01,519 --> 00:12:01,960
Yeah.

241
00:12:10,519 --> 00:12:11,000
Eat.

242
00:12:15,919 --> 00:12:16,480
Is it good?

243
00:12:17,919 --> 00:12:18,720
Yeah. It's good.

244
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:25,320
Have some more. Eat up.

245
00:12:29,639 --> 00:12:30,240
Two thousand.

246
00:12:31,879 --> 00:12:32,639
Thanks.

247
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,799
Wasn't it five hundred to get here?

248
00:12:35,279 --> 00:12:37,080
The ride here was five hundred.

249
00:12:37,080 --> 00:12:38,519
Coming inside is another five hundred.

250
00:12:38,759 --> 00:12:39,600
Food is a thousand.

251
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:41,039
That's two thousand total.

252
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:42,279
Buddy,

253
00:12:42,279 --> 00:12:44,039
you look loaded in that outfit.

254
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:46,919
Well...

255
00:12:47,600 --> 00:12:48,399
Ma Ding,

256
00:12:48,879 --> 00:12:50,360
this whole outfit is rented.

257
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:51,720
How about this?

258
00:12:51,720 --> 00:12:53,480
I'll pay you back
once I make some money.

259
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:01,440
Forget it.

260
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:03,159
I did a good deed.

261
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:04,480
Heaven knows.

262
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:09,480
Well...

263
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:10,840
Hey...

264
00:13:11,480 --> 00:13:13,600
Do you know any way to make ten million?

265
00:13:13,879 --> 00:13:14,559
What?

266
00:13:14,919 --> 00:13:17,159
You don't even have a thousand,
and you want to make ten million?

267
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:19,320
Don't make me laugh.

268
00:13:19,559 --> 00:13:20,399
I need to save someone,

269
00:13:20,919 --> 00:13:22,159
so I need ten million.

270
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:28,600
There is.

271
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:31,200
But

272
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:34,240
you'll need some luck.

273
00:13:37,279 --> 00:13:37,879
Question is, do you have the guts?

274
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:40,159
This... this won't work.

275
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:42,039
Just try it.

276
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:44,600
Huh?

277
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:50,200
We're here.

278
00:13:57,200 --> 00:13:57,639
How's business?

279
00:13:58,679 --> 00:13:59,240
Making good money?

280
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:01,559
Haircut?

281
00:14:06,159 --> 00:14:08,120
This is Langia's biggest jade market.

282
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:10,279
Anyone who's broke comes here
to try their luck.

283
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:13,039
How?

284
00:14:23,759 --> 00:14:24,720
Four stones,

285
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:26,279
not a speck of green.

286
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:28,080
Your luck

287
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:29,559
really couldn't be worse.

288
00:14:29,960 --> 00:14:30,639
Take him away and cut them out.

289
00:14:31,039 --> 00:14:32,679
Remember, both kidneys.

290
00:14:32,840 --> 00:14:33,360
Boss!

291
00:14:33,799 --> 00:14:34,799
Give me one more shot!

292
00:14:34,799 --> 00:14:35,639
I'll turn it around this time.

293
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:36,840
I know I will!

294
00:14:37,679 --> 00:14:38,320
What?

295
00:14:38,759 --> 00:14:40,559
You got a third kidney or something?

296
00:14:43,639 --> 00:14:44,600
Boss!

297
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:45,559
Boss!

298
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:49,840
Boss!

299
00:14:51,399 --> 00:14:52,080
We've got a customer.

300
00:14:54,679 --> 00:14:55,600
First-timer.

301
00:14:55,600 --> 00:14:56,080
Yeah.

302
00:14:57,360 --> 00:14:58,120
Then let's get started.

303
00:14:58,440 --> 00:14:59,159
Got the guts to play?

304
00:15:00,559 --> 00:15:00,960
Buddy,

305
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:01,759
ever bet on rough jade?

306
00:15:02,240 --> 00:15:02,759
Ever tried it before?

307
00:15:03,879 --> 00:15:04,440
No.

308
00:15:04,919 --> 00:15:07,080
My dad lost everything
betting on rough jade.

309
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:10,480
Think it through.

310
00:15:11,519 --> 00:15:12,799
This time, you're not betting money.

311
00:15:13,799 --> 00:15:14,480
You're betting your life.

312
00:15:14,919 --> 00:15:15,519
Think carefully.

313
00:15:16,639 --> 00:15:17,720
Do you dare to try it or not?

314
00:15:22,559 --> 00:15:23,000
I'm in.

315
00:15:23,559 --> 00:15:24,120
Pick one.

316
00:15:45,399 --> 00:15:46,000
This one.

317
00:15:47,039 --> 00:15:47,600
Fine.

318
00:15:47,799 --> 00:15:48,480
One kidney.

319
00:15:49,480 --> 00:15:50,200
Sign here.

320
00:15:50,639 --> 00:15:51,159
A kidney?

321
00:15:57,080 --> 00:15:58,200
Boss, let me think about it.

322
00:16:06,399 --> 00:16:07,799
This one's from Muna.

323
00:16:08,159 --> 00:16:08,759
Not this one.

324
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:10,480
This banding looks promising.

325
00:16:10,840 --> 00:16:11,519
Not this one.

326
00:16:12,080 --> 00:16:13,759
At least check it with a light.

327
00:16:13,759 --> 00:16:15,480
You're feeling them with your eyes shut.
What, are you psychic?

328
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:20,600
We're done for.

329
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:22,720
What a fool.

330
00:16:24,080 --> 00:16:25,039
(I've never bet on jade,)

331
00:16:25,559 --> 00:16:27,360
(but I know every trick
my dad fell for.)

332
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:39,840
(I'll take the chance.)

333
00:16:40,159 --> 00:16:40,919
Still this one?

334
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:43,399
You sure know how to pick them.

335
00:16:44,879 --> 00:16:45,320
Sign.

336
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:46,919
Buddy,

337
00:16:47,559 --> 00:16:48,480
you're betting your life.

338
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:52,879
I'll sign.

339
00:17:20,519 --> 00:17:20,920
Hah.

340
00:17:21,559 --> 00:17:22,359
Junk.

341
00:17:23,240 --> 00:17:24,079
A bet's a bet. You lose.

342
00:17:24,440 --> 00:17:24,839
No.

343
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:27,279
A quarter in from the left.

344
00:17:27,279 --> 00:17:27,559
Cut again.

345
00:17:27,960 --> 00:17:28,720
A quarter in,

346
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:29,519
make another cut.

347
00:17:29,799 --> 00:17:31,200
You can't judge rough jade from one cut.

348
00:17:31,559 --> 00:17:32,000
Hurry.

349
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:32,839
Cut it again.

350
00:17:46,480 --> 00:17:47,359
You're done, buddy.

351
00:17:48,599 --> 00:17:49,480
There goes your kidney.

352
00:17:52,319 --> 00:17:53,880
This... this stone really
isn't showing any green.

353
00:17:54,519 --> 00:17:55,200
No green!

354
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:56,759
No green!

355
00:17:56,759 --> 00:17:58,240
And you're gambling on jade?

356
00:17:58,599 --> 00:17:59,599
Give it up.

357
00:17:59,880 --> 00:18:01,200
Even if you grind it to dust,

358
00:18:01,200 --> 00:18:02,759
it still won't show any green.

359
00:18:03,079 --> 00:18:04,200
Your kidney is mine.

360
00:18:06,799 --> 00:18:07,480
Buddy! Buddy!

361
00:18:07,480 --> 00:18:08,000
No. Wait.

362
00:18:09,079 --> 00:18:10,440
No green doesn't mean it's worthless.

363
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:11,039
Boss.

364
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:11,839
Down the middle.

365
00:18:12,519 --> 00:18:13,079
One last cut.

366
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:20,400
Cut it.

367
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:23,359
Let's see what else is in there.

368
00:18:47,799 --> 00:18:48,599
No green.

369
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:49,880
Still no green.

370
00:18:49,880 --> 00:18:51,720
Red jadeite isn't supposed to be green.

371
00:18:54,680 --> 00:18:55,200
My kidney...

372
00:18:55,759 --> 00:18:56,440
You're not taking it.

373
00:19:06,500 --> 00:19:07,340
♪Dust rises along the border♪

374
00:19:07,340 --> 00:19:08,060
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

375
00:19:08,300 --> 00:19:09,220
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

376
00:19:09,220 --> 00:19:10,140
♪Friends yesterday, now in battle♪

377
00:19:10,140 --> 00:19:11,100
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

378
00:19:11,100 --> 00:19:11,940
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

379
00:19:11,940 --> 00:19:12,860
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

380
00:19:12,860 --> 00:19:14,020
♪My life is mine to bear♪

381
00:19:14,300 --> 00:19:15,780
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

382
00:19:15,900 --> 00:19:17,700
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

383
00:19:17,860 --> 00:19:19,140
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

384
00:19:19,340 --> 00:19:20,020
♪My fate is mine to command♪

385
00:19:20,180 --> 00:19:20,900
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

386
00:19:21,100 --> 00:19:21,780
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

387
00:19:21,940 --> 00:19:22,820
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

388
00:19:22,940 --> 00:19:23,540
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

389
00:19:23,700 --> 00:19:24,700
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

390
00:19:24,700 --> 00:19:25,500
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

391
00:19:25,500 --> 00:19:26,500
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

392
00:19:26,500 --> 00:19:27,340
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

393
00:19:27,340 --> 00:19:28,340
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

394
00:19:28,340 --> 00:19:29,300
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

395
00:19:29,300 --> 00:19:30,220
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

396
00:19:30,220 --> 00:19:31,060
♪Break every shackle, break every lock♪

397
00:19:31,060 --> 00:19:33,260
♪Anger burns inside my chest♪

398
00:19:34,740 --> 00:19:35,700
♪With blood and sweat♪

399
00:19:35,700 --> 00:19:36,700
♪I forge my glory♪

400
00:19:36,700 --> 00:19:37,620
♪In this world of chaos♪

401
00:19:37,620 --> 00:19:38,340
♪I carve out a road to brighter days♪

402
00:19:38,340 --> 00:19:39,020
♪My legend♪

403
00:19:39,020 --> 00:19:40,180
♪I'll write every chapter myself♪

404
00:19:43,700 --> 00:19:45,180
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

405
00:19:45,180 --> 00:19:46,980
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

406
00:19:47,260 --> 00:19:48,420
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

407
00:19:48,540 --> 00:19:49,300
♪My fate is mine to command♪

408
00:19:49,540 --> 00:19:50,180
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

409
00:19:55,820 --> 00:19:56,500
♪My fate is mine to command♪

410
00:19:56,820 --> 00:19:57,700
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪
